Usage: pqc-scan probe ssh-kex [OPTIONS] --port <PORT> --host-key-file <HOST_KEY_FILE> <HOST>

Arguments:
  <HOST>  

Options:
      --port <PORT>                    
      --allow-cidr <ALLOW_CIDR>        
      --out-dir <OUT_DIR>              
      --lang <LANG>                    [default: en] [possible values: en, ja]
      --host-key-file <HOST_KEY_FILE>  Separately provisioned trusted OpenSSH Ed25519 PUBLIC host key for this endpoint
  -h, --help                           Print help
